Privacy Policy

Last updated: September 16, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how Target Master handles information when you use the Target Master mobile application.

Information We Collect

If you choose to sign in using Google Sign-In, Target Master may receive basic information provided by Google, such as your name, email address, and profile information, depending on the permissions requested during sign-in.

We use this information to provide authentication and account-related functionality within the game.

How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

- Create and maintain your game account.
- Authenticate your identity.
- Provide game functionality.
- Save and associate your game progress with your account.
- Respond to support requests.

We do not sell your personal information.

Google Services

Target Master may use Google services, including Google Sign-In, to provide authentication and related functionality.

Your use of Google services is also subject to Google's applicable policies and privacy practices.

Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information associated with the application and to prevent unauthorized access.

However, no method of electronic storage or transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure.

Data Retention and Deletion

We retain account information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide the application's services or comply with applicable legal obligations.

If you would like to request deletion of your account or associated personal information, please contact us using the support email associated with Target Master.

Children's Privacy

Target Master is not intended to knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable laws.

If you believe that a child has provided personal information to us, please contact us so that we can review and take appropriate action.

Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.

Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or the handling of your information, please contact us using the support email associated with Target Master.